OL,3,GNEWSAOrchestra named Brighton Dome's
OL,4,Aresident ensemble
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Brighton's best-known arts
OL,7,Fvenues has cemented a partnership with
OL,8,Fa local orchestra that dates back for
OL,9,F100 years.
OL,11,FBrighton Philharmonic Orchestra,
OL,12,Ffounded in 1925, is to become the
OL,13,Fresident orchestra at Brighton Dome.
OL,15,FThe orchestra first played at Brighton
OL,16,FDome's Concert Hall in 1928 and has
OL,17,Fbeen a regular part of its programme
OL,18,Fever since.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
