OL,3,GNEWSAOrchestra named Brighton Dome's
OL,4,Aresident ensemble
OL,5,
OL,6,FJoanna MacGregor, chief executive and
OL,7,Fmusic director of the orchestra, said
OL,8,Fthe move recognised the ensemble's
OL,9,Fcontribution to the city's cultural
OL,10,Flife over the past century.
